SUMMARY:[Cognitive Science & Computational Cognition][Computational Neurosc
 ience] CogSci 2027 - Contributed paper submission deadline (estimated)
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: Annual Meeting of the Cognitive Science Socie
 ty\nWebsite: https://cognitivesciencesociety.org/cogsci-2027/\nSource URL
 : https://cognitivesciencesociety.org/cogsci-2026/\nLocation: Bilbao\, Sp
 ain\nTopics: Cognitive Science & Computational Cognition\, Computational 
 Neuroscience\, Machine Learning\, Natural Language Processing & LLMs\nSiz
 e: L\nSubmission type: Paper-based / abstract presentations\nConfidence: 
 estimated\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: Society confirms Bilbao\
 , Euskalduna Convention Centre\, Jul 28-31. No 2027 submission timetable 
 found. The paper deadline is a Feb 2 proxy from the prior annual meeting\
 ; the cutoff hour and submission tracks need reconfirmation. Size L is an
  editorial estimate.\nScope: Interdisciplinary study of cognition and the
  mind\, connecting psychology\, linguistics\, artificial intelligence\, n
 euroscience\, philosophy\, anthropology\, and education. Computational mo
 dels and experiments should illuminate cognitive processes and behavior. 
 An AI paper belongs here through its contribution to understanding cognit
 ion\, not solely through a predictive performance improvement.\nAdditiona
 l topics: \nScope sources (2026): https://cognitivesciencesociety.org/sub
 missions-faq/\, https://cognitivesciencesociety.org/\nScope last checked:
  2026-10-07
URL:https://cognitivesciencesociety.org/cogsci-2026/
END:VEVENT
